# Formatting in this repo is opt-in for scripts/ only — everything else is ignored.
#
# Prettier's HTML parser collapses the {% comment %} blocks in the Liquid templates
# under _includes/ and _layouts/ into a single reflowed paragraph and moves Liquid
# tags across line boundaries, which breaks the templates outright. The remaining
# hand-written sources (SCSS, front-end JS, content Markdown) were authored before
# Prettier existed here; running it over them produces 250-310 changed lines per
# file, which would bury real changes in review noise.
#
# lint-staged is scoped to scripts/**/*.{mjs,cjs,js} for the same reason. This file
# keeps a stray `npm run format` from doing the damage the hook prevents.

# Build output, caches and dependencies
_site/
.jekyll-cache/
.sass-cache/
node_modules/
vendor/

# Liquid templates and every other HTML file
_includes/
_layouts/
**/*.html

# Content pages
**/*.md
**/*.markdown

# Jekyll data and generated artifacts — owned by scripts/, never hand-formatted
_data/
site-index.json

# Styles and front-end JavaScript
_sass/
assets/
sw.js

# …except the mcdev Pipeline Builder JS, which is scoped-linted/formatted on its own.
!assets/js/mcdev-pipeline-builder.js
!assets/js/mcdev-pipeline-config-builder.js
!assets/js/mcdev-pipeline-validations-builder.js

# Site, CI and package configuration
_config.yml
.github/
manifest.webmanifest
package.json
package-lock.json
